For my part, I'd wear the MR cloak and equip the amulet of reflection.
I tried GDSM with a monk once and it was worse than useless.  Monks
aren't good weapon fighters in Gehennom -- not even with the staff of
aesculapius -- so you might focus on enhancing your spellcasting
abilities.  This is the time to wish for spellbooks of magic missile
and identify, if you don't know those skills yet.  Using wands and
spells will get more and more useful from here on out, especially
versus master kaen.

This may mean trading up for such things as a robe, a helm of
brilliance, and dexterity gloves; but don't waste your wishes -- just
see what you need to get magic missile at 0% failure.

Rings of free action and conflict are almost necessities later on.



